> Printed by DeviceMenu `$943D` at row 17, column 2, attribute `$47`. "BY  TEQUE SOFTWARE  DEV. LTD", "(c)   ARGUS PRESS SOFTWARE LTD" (`$7F` the ROM's copyright sign), "PROGRAM   SHAUN HOLLINGWORTH", "          PETE  HARRAP", "+2 MUSIC  BEN DAGLISH", each line ended by `$0D`, the last by 0 (`$95FC`). The "+2 MUSIC" line is printed on a 48K too.
