$9AD5 w EffectCellsA 8 ; The tile-map addresses of the room's tiles $B5 (base set) or $DD (alternate set), zero-ended
> Built on every room set-up by FindTileCells $9A8C (from $98C2) after SetUpRoomTiles clears $9AD5-$9AF4. Read each pass by the effect routine $91C0: with the base set the first two cells show a tile $B5 animated in 4 frames by PassCount $5C02 with random pixel noise; with the alternate set the words go in pairs, two $DD cells on one row that $91C0 joins with a noise beam, and the hero inside it gets event $18 ($9255). 103 894 reads over the play builds; zeros in the image.
$9AE5 w EffectCellsB 8 ; The tile-map addresses of the room's tiles $8C (alternate set only), zero-ended
> Built by FindTileCells from $98D0 when the alternate set is in; read each pass by $9282 through $92BD (91 023 reads). Room $3B has the most, 6.
$9AF5 b CheckpointRooms 8 ; The 44 rooms where SaveRespawnPoint records the restart point, then $FF
